		(property "Description" "OPSCO SK6805-EC15 single-wire addressable RGB LED, SMD-4P 1.5x1.5x0.65mm, LCSC C2890035. Pin table (1=DIN,2=VDD,3=DOUT,4=GND) verified against iPixel LED SK6805-EC15 REV.04 EN-20190527 datasheet PIN configuration table (Sec.5): 1 DIN control data signal input, 2 VDD power supply LED, 3 DOUT control data signal output, 4 GND. VDD datasheet range +3.7~+5.5V (sourcing.md flags 3.3V operation as below-floor but standard practice) -- project-authored Task 9, not on stock KiCad libs." (at 0 0 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
