	(text "LED-kill gate logic (high-side, amendment 1): default (SW2 idle + GP9 released) -> R84 100k pulldown -> gate=0V -> Q33 ON -> LED_PWR=+3V3 (LEDs on).\nSW2 engaged (throw A) OR GP9 driven HIGH -> gate pulled toward +3V3 through 1k (SW2) or 10k (GP9) -> |Vgs| << DMG3415U-7 threshold -> Q33 OFF -> LEDs dark.\nR83=1k dominates R84/R85 even if GP9 is simultaneously driven LOW (worst-case conflict still yields Vgs=-0.33V, solidly off) -- SW2 always wins. See task-9-report.md for the full truth table + arithmetic."
		(at 200 190 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9e91037a-ef78-4c9f-9a1c-feef6d718711")
	)
