	(text "POE_STATUS divider (amendment 2): POE_STS_RAW (0-11V, from power_input N_BTSTAT) -100k-> POE_STATUS -22k-> GND.\n11V*22k/122k=1.98V (also fine at 0V). BLOCKED: brief's own GP0-GP29 map is FULLY populated (30/30, incl. 3 J18\nspares) with no POE_STATUS slot -- per task instructions (\"any pin conflict: STOP, do not shuffle silently\") this net is\nNOT bound to an RP2040 pin here. Recommend GP29 (spare-ADC) as the natural fit (analog-capable, currently unused\nexcept as a J18 spare) -- needs a human decision before binding. See task-9-report.md."
		(at 345 30 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a9d5831c-6361-4098-9493-fdd9252244f7")
	)
